#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Muundo mmoja tu wa uso umeandikishwa. Taa hubadilisha jinsi uso wako u"
"navyoonekana kwenye kamera, hivyo mfano mmoja unaweza kushindwa jioni "
"chini ya taa (au mchana). Ongeza muundo wa pili uliorekodiwa kwa mwang"
"a tofauti ili kuendelea kufungua kutegemewa wakati wowote wa siku."

